Description: Steam Gaming Mode session for Ubuntu 26.04
 Provides a console-style Steam Gaming Mode session for Ubuntu Desktop
 using Gamescope and Steam GamepadUI.
 .
 Includes the validated custom Gamescope runtime, session switching,
 automatic GDM session selection, Gaming Mode integration and diagnostic
 tools.
